AQTf5E4zthNAGSlEQgxg_EGCibP9BQvYAwQrokoPVLHC9w&oe=6AEDD72C"}, "display_name": "Baa Baa Dream", "keywords": ["relaxing", "healing", "bedtime", "dream", "cute"], "long_description": "\ud83d\udc11 **A dreamlike space where reality fades into imagination**\n\nOn sleepless nights, the sheep you once counted come to life \u2014 soft, silly, and full of wonder. They drift gently into your room, bringing calm, warmth, and a touch of magic.\n\n\u2728 **Watch & Relax**\n\nLet the Baa Baa float peacefully through your room. No goals, no pressure \u2014 just zone out and enjoy.\n\n\ud83d\udc0f **Touch & Interact**\n\nCatch, pet, shake, or gently toss them. Each Baa Baa responds in its own playful way.\n\n\ud83d\udcda **Discover & Collect**\n\nMeet over 30 unique Baa Baa and save your favorites in your dream journal.\n\n\ud83d\udecf **Play While Lying Down**\n\nSupports hand tracking and lying-down mode \u2014 perfect for winding down before sleep.\n\n**Baa Baa Dream isn\u2019t a game to beat \u2014 it\u2019s a moment to keep**\nTry it tonight and meet the softest dreams waiting just around you.", "short_description": "A dreamy experience of collecting floating Baa Baa."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://baabaadream.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "QUX", "support_website_url": "https://baabaadream.com/", "website_url": "https://baabaadream.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING